      [],
      "Two approaches to understanding what the field knows about learning will be explored. The course will follow classic theories and ask how the theories impact education. The course will also review current research on elements of learning and how each of them are evaluated and their implications for education. Together, these approaches will provide students with an understanding of classic and current theories of learning, and elements of emergent research.",
