      "Introduces data literacy as a required key twenty-first century skill. Students will learn the nature of data across different domains and the concepts and skills of data visualization by understanding, questioning, and problematizing how data are generated, analyzed, and used. Students will be able to apply its concepts and skills to visualize your own data, interpret the findings, and examine the impacts of data-driven decisions.",
